{"slug":"Noobs-vs-Zombies-Tycoon-2-Damage-Editor-2147","_id":"625f80b36619d469a9eedf2e","title":"Damage Editor","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c782f1","gameId":2639055821,"name":"Noobs vs Zombies Tycoon 2","imageUrl":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/dce275be39dcffc8338687ecfeb171b0/500/280/Image/Jpeg","placeId":2639055821},"features":"Multiplies the amount of damage to every weapon of yours. Since modding takes time, multiplying it up to 26 may take a few minutes, going even further for the multiplier to minutes or hours.\nExecute in game, not Lobby. \nChange the 26 to your preferred number.\n\nORIGINAL THREAD: https://v3rmillion.net/showthread.php?tid=1139080\nThere are known issues:\nBuying things as Leader may take up ALL of your money, since you bought 26 of them.\nGuns may generate ALOT of smoke, chewing all of your frames.\nDonating/depositing in bank DEPOSITS and DONATES all of your money.\nBe wary of this!","tags":[],"script":"local settings = {repeatamount = 26, exceptions = {\"SayMessageRequest\",\"MeleeUpdateEvent\",\"NinjaBombEvent\",\"BulletUpdateEvent\"}}\n\nlocal mt = getrawmetatable(game)\nlocal old = mt.__namecall\nsetreadonly(mt, false)\n\nmt.__namecall = function(uh, ...)\n  local args = {...}\n  local method = getnamecallmethod()\n  for i,o in next, settings.exceptions do\n      if uh.Name == o then\n          return old(uh, ...)\n      end\n  end\n  if method == \"FireServer\" or method == \"InvokeServer\" then\n      for i = 1,settings.repeatamount do\n          old(uh, ...)\n      end\n  end\n  return old(uh, ...)\nend\n\nsetreadonly(mt, true)","owner":{"_id":"620b4026729d9f4c1fd2f981","username":"CatAutism","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/620b4026729d9f4c1fd2f981-1693789040768.png","status":"offline","id":"620b4026729d9f4c1fd2f981","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":14837,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2022-04-20T03:40:35.195Z","dis